    apply: "Read Isaiah 6:1-8 slowly in a quiet place and speak back to God what you notice about him. Confess any sin that comes to mind and receive his forgiveness. Then ask, Here I am, and be ready to take a small step of service this week.",
    activity: "Read Isaiah 6:1-8 aloud with different learners reading the angels, Isaiah and the Lord. Ask the class to list what Isaiah saw, felt and did in order. Discuss how worship, confession and service are linked. Close with a hymn or song of God's holiness.",
