    teacher: "Some learners associate holiness with rules and fear. Begin with the beauty and grandeur of God and with his mercy. Avoid presenting God's holiness as a threat to frighten but as a truth that leads to worship. Be ready for learners who struggle with guilt, and point them to forgiveness.",
    assess: "Weekly check: ask learners what holiness means for God and how Isaiah responded.",
