    apply: "Write down one area of your thinking that needs to be prepared for action, such as how you spend free time or what you watch, and decide on a change. Pray each morning Lord, make me like my Father. Choose a Scripture that speaks of God's holiness to carry with you.",
    activity: "Draw a family tree on the board with God as Father and believers as children. Ask what family likenesses we should show. Read 1 Peter 1:13-16 and underline the commands. Discuss practical meanings for school, work and home.",
