    mcq1: ["According to 1 Peter 1:15-16, why are we to be holy?", ["Because he who called us is holy", "Because the law requires it", "Because others are watching", "Because it brings wealth"], 0, "God is holy and we are to be like him."],
    mcq2: ["What does Hebrews 12:14 tell us to strive for?", ["Peace with everyone and holiness", "Wealth and status", "Silence", "Isolation"], 0, "Peace and holiness."],
